" alt="D’Tails Pet Grooming held $20 dog nail trims Saturday to raise money for Jason Parrish, the..." loading="lazy" data-tb-thumbnail="" src="https://gray-wrdw-prod.gtv-cdn.com/resizer/v2/XLT2EYSDWFE7DL7Q5DRRL6YDAI.png?auth=724a164e6fbe52debb4b5f7cd093975a2c243cbad95c45636b07675a2e044fb3&amp;width=800&amp;height=450&amp;smart=true" width="800" height="450"/></a></div></figure></div><div class="headlines | card-title mb-1"><h6 class="headline | mb-0 fw-bold"><a class="text-reset" href="/2026/08/01/local-pet-groomer-raises-funds-augusta-restaurant-owner-after-heart-surgery/" rel="" target="_self" data-tb-link=""><span data-tb-title=""><i class="far fa-play-circle"></i><span style="textDecoration: none;"> </span>Local pet groomer raises funds for Augusta restaurant owner after heart surgery</span></a></h6></div></div></div><div class="feed-divider | w-100 d-none d-sm-block d-md-block d-lg-block d-xl-block"></div><div class="flex-feature | card mx-2 mb-3 align-items-start border image-left position-relative w-100" data-tb-region-item=""><div class="card-body w-100 px-2 py-1 image_headline"><div class="image-container position-relative mb-0 pt-0 w-33 float-start me-2"><figure class="media-item | figure media-item-image mb-0 lazy-load constrained image-ratio-16x9"><div class="figure-wrapper img-wrapper figure-img mb-0"><a class="link | text-reset d-block h-100 w-100" href="/2026/08/01/bethel-ame-church-holds-backpack-giveaway-csra-families/" rel="" target="_self" data-tb-link=""><img class="rounded-0 img-fluid" alt="Bethel AME Church held a backpack giveaway, providing families with backpacks, school..." loading="lazy" data-tb-thumbnail="" src="https://gray-wrdw-prod.gtv-cdn.com/resizer/v2/PP3HYHGOGNG3FL7R6QJPAENQOE.png?auth=0518482b791a62970d1fe2c67f048b096123444e6eb2303527b868b381c5d5f3&amp;width=800&amp;height=450&amp;smart=true" width="800" height="450"/></a></div></figure></div><div class="headlines | card-title mb-1"><h6 class="headline | mb-0 fw-bold"><a class="text-reset" href="/2026/08/01/bethel-ame-church-holds-backpack-giveaway-csra-families/" rel="" target="_self" data-tb-link=""><span data-tb-title=""><i class="far fa-play-circle"></i><span style="textDecoration: none;"> </span>Bethel AME Church holds backpack giveaway for CSRA families</span></a></h6></div></div></div><div class="feed-divider | w-100 d-none d-sm-block d-md-block d-lg-block d-xl-block"></div><div class="flex-feature | card mx-2 mb-3 align-items-start border image-left position-relative w-100" data-tb-region-item=""><div class="card-body w-100 px-2 py-1 image_headline"><div class="image-container position-relative mb-0 pt-0 w-33 float-start me-2"><figure class="media-item | figure media-item-image mb-0 lazy-load constrained image-ratio-16x9"><div class="figure-wrapper img-wrapper figure-img mb-0"><a class="link | text-reset d-block h-100 w-100" href="/2026/08/01/augusta-dream-center-helps-students-gear-up-back-to-school-season/" rel="" target="_self" data-tb-link=""><img class="rounded-0 img-fluid" alt="Augusta Dream Center helps students gear up for back-to-school season" loading="lazy" data-tb-thumbnail="" src="https://gray-wrdw-prod.gtv-cdn.com/resizer/v2/5CJI62Z3GFBE7KD26PAEDF7Y2M.jpg?auth=4d4776497d8e69b1cda18707ac7b9380c04df915735b522d3641a0abe2938011&amp;width=800&amp;height=450&amp;smart=true" width="800" height="450"/></a></div></figure></div><div class="headlines | card-title mb-1"><h6 class="headline | mb-0 fw-bold"><a class="text-reset" href="/2026/08/01/augusta-dream-center-helps-students-gear-up-back-to-school-season/" rel="" target="_self" data-tb-link=""><span data-tb-title=""><i class="far fa-play-circle"></i><span style="textDecoration: none;"> </span>Augusta Dream Center helps students gear up for back-to-school season</span></a></h6></div></div></div><div class="feed-divider | w-100 d-none d-sm-block d-md-block d-lg-block d-xl-block"></div><div class="flex-feature | card mx-2 mb-3 align-items-start border image-left position-relative w-100" data-tb-region-item=""><div class="card-body w-100 px-2 py-1 image_headline"><div class="image-container position-relative mb-0 pt-0 w-33 float-start me-2"><figure class="media-item | figure media-item-image mb-0 lazy-load constrained image-ratio-16x9"><div class="figure-wrapper img-wrapper figure-img mb-0"><a class="link | text-reset d-block h-100 w-100" href="/2026/07/28/1-person-injured-shooting-west-vineland-road/" rel="" target="_self" data-tb-link=""><img class="rounded-0 img-fluid" alt="As of about 1:30 p.m. July 28, Richmond County Sheriff’s Office deputies were on the scene of..." loading="lazy" data-tb-thumbnail="" src="https://gray-wrdw-prod.gtv-cdn.com/resizer/v2/XIQJBWCRBVAC5DMTI7XT5JFJ5A.png?auth=fc2bf039e4cbb7b71a4292bd5d2d748e6028144ef43ce5cd957cafa9667dbbd0&amp;width=800&amp;height=450&amp;smart=false&amp;focal=797%2C364" width="800" height="450"/></a></div></figure></div><div class="headlines | card-title mb-1"><h6 class="headline | mb-0 fw-bold"><a class="text-reset" href="/2026/07/28/1-person-injured-shooting-west-vineland-road/" rel="" target="_self" data-tb-link=""><span data-tb-title=""><i class="far fa-play-circle"></i><span style="textDecoration: none;"> </span>1 person injured in shooting on West Vineland Road</span></a></h6></div></div></div><div class="feed-divider | w-100 d-none d-sm-block d-md-block d-lg-block d-xl-block"></div><div class="flex-feature | card mx-2 mb-3 align-items-start border image-left position-relative w-100" data-tb-region-item=""><div class="card-body w-100 px-2 py-1 image_headline"><div class="image-container position-relative mb-0 pt-0 w-33 float-start me-2"><figure class="media-item | figure media-item-image mb-0 lazy-load constrained image-ratio-16x9"><div class="figure-wrapper img-wrapper figure-img mb-0"><a class="link | text-reset d-block h-100 w-100" href="/2026/07/31/sheriffs-office-seeking-two-males-wanted-questioning-broad-street-homicide/" rel="" target="_self" data-tb-link=""><img class="round